--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 075ae7a4e0c44354e9959697c9e269fc, type: 3}
  m_Name: Industrial Expansion
  legacyName: Industrial Expansion
  description: 'Production-category buildings generate 8% more Production.'
  flavorText: 'The disaster could have become the moment industrialization lost its legitimacy. Instead, reconstruction became an opportunity to replace damaged capacity with larger, more efficient, and better-designed facilities. Engineers rebuilt layouts, manufacturers adopted lessons learned from failed machinery, and investors discovered that replacing yesterday''s plant could produce more than simply restoring what had existed before. Expansion became associated with recovery rather than recklessness. The lesson passed into later generations of industry: when productive capacity is destroyed, rebuilding the same system exactly as it was may be the least imaginative response.'
  policyPointCost: 1
  attackBonus: 0
  defenseBonus: 0
  movementBonus: 0
  attackModifier: 0
  defenseModifier: 0
  foodModifier: 0
  productionModifier: 0
  goldModifier: 0
